<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy Policy – BOT PAPA</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for BOT PAPA AI phone assistant services." />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #050816;
      --bg-soft: #0b1020;
      --accent: #00e0ff;
      --accent-soft: rgba(0, 224, 255, 0.12);
      --text: #f5f7ff;
      --muted: #a3aac2;
      --danger: #ff4b6b;
      --shadow-soft: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-full: 999px;
      --border-soft: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text",
        "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #101735 0, #050816 55%, #02030a 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 20px 64px;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 10px 16px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 224, 255, 0.12), transparent);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      position: sticky;
      top: 16px;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }

    .brand-text-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .brand-text-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .header-right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 6px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .header-top-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .pill {
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      border: var(--border-soft);
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(5, 8, 22, 0.9);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 9px 18px;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e0ff, #7b3fff);
      color: #050816;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn-primary span {
      font-size: 16px;
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.06);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      filter: brightness(0.98);
      transform: translateY(0);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    }

    main {
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .content-card {
      padding: 24px 20px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(8, 13, 34, 0.95), rgba(2, 4, 13, 0.98));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .content-card h1 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .content-card h2 {
      margin-top: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .content-card p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .content-card ul {
      margin: 4px 0 10px 18px;
      padding: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .content-card li {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      header {
        position: static;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
      }
      .header-right {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      .header-top-row {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        row-gap: 6px;
      }
      .content-card {
        padding: 20px 16px 18px;
      }
      footer {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">
          <img src="BOT_PAPA-removebg.png" alt="BOT PAPA Logo" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-text-title">BOT PAPA</div>
          <div class="brand-text-sub">AI Phone Assistants for Small Businesses</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="header-right">
        <div class="header-top-row">
          <div class="pill">
            Privacy Policy • BOT PAPA
          </div>
          <a href="index" class="btn-primary">
            Back to main site <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="content-card">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how BOT PAPA collects and uses personal data
          in connection with our website and AI phone assistant services.
          It is intended to meet the requirements of GDPR and comparable data
          protection laws where applicable.[web:86][web:89]
        </p>

        <h2>1. Controller</h2>
        <p>
          The controller responsible for data processing is:
        </p>
        <p>
          BOT PAPA / Haus iT Service &amp; Vertrieb<br />
          Bodo Kopplin<br />
          (Insert postal address here)<br />
          (Insert country)
        </p>
        <p>
          Email: (insert contact email that is actually monitored)<br />
          Phone: (insert phone number)
        </p>

        <h2>2. Personal data we process</h2>
        <p>
          We process the following categories of personal data when you use our website,
          contact us, or use our AI phone assistant:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact data (name, phone number, email address).</li>
          <li>Business information (company name, industry, location).</li>
          <li>Call and inquiry details (topic, time, notes taken by the assistant).</li>
          <li>Technical usage data of the website (IP address, browser type, time of access, pages visited), if collected.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Purposes and legal bases</h2>
        <p>
          We use personal data only for clearly defined purposes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to contact requests and discovery calls.</li>
          <li>To plan, configure and operate AI phone assistant projects.</li>
          <li>To improve our services and internal processes.</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations (e.g. tax and commercial law retention).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Where GDPR applies, we rely in particular on Article 6(1)(b) GDPR (contract
          or pre‑contractual measures), Article 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interests),
          and Article 6(1)(c) GDPR (legal obligations) as legal bases.[web:89]
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data from calls and forms</h2>
        <p>
          When you speak with an AI phone assistant or fill in a discovery form,
          we process the information you provide in order to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Understand your request and route it correctly.</li>
          <li>Prepare callbacks and follow‑up communication.</li>
          <li>Design and optimize the AI assistant for the specific business.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Depending on the setup, call content may be converted into text
          (transcription) and stored for documentation and quality purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Use of processors and third‑party tools</h2>
        <p>
          We work with selected service providers for hosting, telephony,
          AI models and analytics. These providers act as data processors
          based on data processing agreements and process data only according
          to our instructions.[web:86]
        </p>
        <p>
          Typical categories of processors include:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Hosting and infrastructure providers (e.g. for databases and servers).</li>
          <li>Telephony platforms (e.g. SIP/VoIP providers).</li>
          <li>AI infrastructure and model providers.</li>
          <li>Tools for CRM, ticketing or analytics, where implemented.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. International data transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on the infrastructure used, data may be processed in or transferred
          to countries outside the EU/EEA. In such cases, we rely on appropriate
          safeguards, such as standard contractual clauses or adequacy decisions,
          where required by law.[web:89]
        </p>

        <h2>7. Retention periods</h2>
        <p>
          We store personal data only as long as necessary for the purposes described
          above or as required by statutory retention obligations (for example under
          tax and commercial law).[web:86]
        </p>
        <p>
          After the end of the relevant retention period, data will be deleted
          or anonymized in accordance with our internal policies.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
        <p>
          Where GDPR applies, you have in particular the following rights:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Right of access to your personal data.</li>
          <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate data.</li>
          <li>Right to erasure (“right to be forgotten”) under the legal conditions.</li>
          <li>Right to restriction of processing.</li>
          <li>Right to data portability.</li>
          <li>Right to object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
          <li>Right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>9. Contact for privacy questions</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or the processing
          of your personal data, you can contact:
        </p>
        <p>
          BOT PAPA / Haus iT Service &amp; Vertrieb<br />
          Attn: Data Protection<br />
          (Insert postal address here)<br />
          Email: (insert privacy contact email)
        </p>

        <h2>10. Updates to this Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, for example
          when we add new services or change our technical infrastructure.
          The current version is always available on this page.[web:86]
        </p>
        <p>
          Last updated: (insert date)
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>© 2026 BOT PAPA – AI Telephone Assistants</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="imprint_en">Imprint</a>
        <a href="privacy_en">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="terms_en">Terms of Service</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
